  "summary": "The AA4/8 is the Agenzia delle Entrate’s form to apply for an Italian tax code (codice fiscale), to report a change in your details, or to ask for a codice fiscale card or a replacement health card (Tessera Sanitaria). You fill it in if you need a codice fiscale and no other office assigns it to you, for example as an EU citizen moving to Italy, a non-resident student or worker, or someone abroad who has to sign a contract or accept an inheritance in Italy.",
